    <h1>Squarespace Privacy Policy Generator</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Published August 5, 2026</p>

    <p>Squarespace does not include a built-in privacy policy generator. Its help center offers sample privacy policy messages and its Cookies &amp; Data Privacy panel adds a cookie banner, but neither produces a complete policy that reflects what your Squarespace site actually collects through Form blocks, Commerce checkout, Member Sites, Acuity Scheduling, and scripts added through code injection. To cover those features, you can use <a href="https://buildprivacypolicy.com/">BuildPrivacyPolicy's free policy builder</a>: select the Squarespace integrations you have enabled (Google Analytics, Mailchimp, Stripe, Meta Pixel, and others) and the regions your visitors come from, then paste the finished policy into a Squarespace page or host it for free. No signup, no payment.</p>

    <p>This guide covers the full picture for Squarespace site owners: whether Squarespace offers a built-in generator, why every Squarespace site needs a privacy policy, which Squarespace features the document must disclose, where to place it inside Squarespace, and how to generate one in minutes rather than drafting from scratch.</p>

