    <h2 id="example-policy">Sample Squarespace Privacy Policy You Can Copy</h2>

    <p>Below is a complete privacy policy written for a fictional Squarespace website called "[Your Website Name]." It covers the data flows that Squarespace sites handle by default -- Squarespace Analytics, form block submissions, Squarespace Commerce with Stripe payment processing, built-in email campaigns, and common third-party integrations added through code injection. Copy the entire block, replace the bracketed placeholders with your site's details, and remove any sections that do not apply.</p>

